{"id":"111bbf1b6bb9102a","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glp-finite-support.md","title":"Finite Modal Support and Derived Necessitation in GLP","display":"lem-glp-finite-support — Finite Modal Support and Derived Necessitation in GLP","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glp-finite-support","aliases":["89-lem-glp-finite-support"],"display":"lem-glp-finite-support — Finite Modal Support and Derived Necessitation in GLP","depends_on":["[[89-df-glp-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glp-finite-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glp-finite-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glp-finite-support — Finite Modal Support and Derived Necessitation in GLP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5518caddec83ace1\" href=\"?note=5518caddec83ace1\" title=\"89-df-glp-logic\">89-df-glp-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5518caddec83ace1\" href=\"?note=5518caddec83ace1\" title=\"89-df-glp-logic\">89-df-glp-logic</a> 定义的定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\)</span> 是公式的盒索引集合。</li>\n<li>下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span> 均遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；有限模态指标限制仍取已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Idx}\">\\(\\mathrm{Idx}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glp\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\ (n&lt;N),\\\\\n&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ ([n]A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}),\\\\\n&amp;m\\le n\\Longrightarrow([m]A\\to[n]A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glp\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\ (n&lt;N),\\\\\n&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ ([n]A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}),\\\\\n&amp;m\\le n\\Longrightarrow([m]A\\to[n]A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 p.207（有限支持备注及定义的直接推论）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>第一式按公式结构归纳；无盒时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=0\">\\(N=0\\)</span>，否则取有限索引集最大元加一。第三式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-m\">\\(n-m\\)</span> 归纳，依次合成相邻单调模式；第二式先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0]\">\\([0]\\)</span> 必然化，再用第三式。</p>\n<p>语法有限支持是原书 GLP 完全性推广中特别指出的条件，但它本身不证明“任意有限片段对全部 GLP 保守”，也不说明可以不经证明地把模态种类截断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glp-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glp-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glp-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P$ 是 [[89-df-glp-logic]] 定义的定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Idx}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Idx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glp\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists N\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\ (n<N),\\\\\n&A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ ([n]A\\in\\mathrm{GLP}),\\\\\n&m\\le n\\Longrightarrow([m]A\\to[n]A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N=0","display":false},{"tex":"n-m","display":false},{"tex":"[0]","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GLP（p.207）：[[89-df-polymodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glp-logic]] → [[89-df-glsp-logic]] → [[89-lem-glp-finite-support]]；与 GLB 的连接见 [[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["5518caddec83ace1"]}